{{DISPLAYTITLE:Noribogaine}}

'''Noribogaine''' (also known as '''O-desmethylibogaine''', and '''12-hydroxyibogamine''') is a naturally occuring [[oneirogen]] of the [[Tryptamines|tryptamine]] family. It is the main [[Psychoactive substance index|psychoactive]] [[metabolit]] of [[ibogaine]] and seems to play the bigger role in the antiaddictive effects of [[ibogaine]] or extractions from [[Tabernanthe iboga (botany)|Tabernanthe Iboga]].

